{"articleNo":"243646","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=243646&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 2020 디자인씽킹 교육생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.10.14","hit":"5005","attachments":[{"name":"디자인씽킹_신청서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=243646&attachNo=93165"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">창업원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">창업교육센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">에서&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움;\">창의적 문제해결 역량강화 목적으로</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2020 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">디자인씽킹 교육</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">」</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">을 아래와 같이 실시하오니&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">교육을 희망하는 학생은 기간 내에 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-as